@startuml
title Concert Details - Conceptual Class Diagram
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide circle
hide methods

class User
class Concert {
  name
  genre
  date
}
class Venue {
  name
  city
}
class Ticket {
  price
  seat rating
  link
}

User "1" -- "0..*" Concert : views details of
Concert "0..*" -- "1" Venue : held at
Concert "1" -- "0..*" Ticket : has
@enduml
